          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p><strong>Concept used:</strong></p>\n\n<p>Follow BODMAS rule to solve this question, as per the order given below</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/quesImage223.png\" /></p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>79.97 &asymp; 80</p>\n\n<p>84.95 &asymp; 85</p>\n\n<p>107.93 &asymp; 108</p>\n\n<p>4.89 &asymp; 5</p>\n\n<p>4.99 &asymp; 5</p>\n\n<p>So, final value by using BODMAS rule,</p>\n\n<p>(80 + 85 &ndash; 108 + 5) &times; 5 = ?</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (80 + 85 + 5&nbsp;&ndash; 108)&nbsp;&times; 5 = ?</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (170&nbsp;&ndash; 108)&nbsp;&times; 5 = ?</p>\n\n<p>? = 62 &times; 5</p>\n\n<p>? = 310</p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4; The value of ? is 310</strong></p>",
          "topic": "Test"
